WEBVTT

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:08.950
Tsutsun.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.830
Uh, what? You've been extremely assertive today, huh...

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:17.000
Oh? But you can do whatever you want to, you know.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.410
We're dating, after all.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.790
A-anything I want?

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:22.870
Yeah.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.910
Okay then, is it okay if I bury my face
into the back of your head?!

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.540
Wait a second!

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.410
Tsutsui! Just what kind of pervert are you?!

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:32.790
E-Ezomichi?!

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:36.370
Until just now, I was your "wife"! You called me your wife!

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:37.000
Huh?!

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.410
That's right, Tsutsui!

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:41.870
And you said we could game all day today!

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:43.040
You too, Ito?!

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.160
If you want to, Tsutsun, it's okay.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.580
Are you sure?! I can even bury my face?!

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.160
Between me and that Iroha girl, who do you choose!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:53.120
Y-you've got it all wrong! It's just that her hair is so soft!

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.620
You cheater!

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.160
What? Was that a dream?

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.410
Ouch.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.620
Oh, come to think of it, she was at my house...

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:16.540
What am I doing?!

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:20.660
I've been so weird lately.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:23.870
I'm going crazy. I can't keep going on like this.

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:28.830
Oh no. I'm sorry, Tsutsun, I fell...

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:39.950
Thank you, Tsutsun. See you tomorrow.

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:18.660
EPISODE 3

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:18.660
ABOUT THE TIME NORMIES
MADE ME EVEN WORSE.

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:15.660
Tsutsui!

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.450
What's wrong? Why the long face?

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:20.000
No... It's nothing.

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:24.000
Let's go buy games today!
C'mon, you said we'd go earlier.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.200
Today, huh...?

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:28.790
I may have said something about going to see her today.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:29.870
I see...

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:30.700
Sorry.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:33.950
Don't worry about it! I'm okay going by myself.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:37.290
This is the first time I've seen Ito looking so sad!

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:40.540
W-wait a second. I'll go! I'll go, I'll go!

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:41.830
Huh? But...

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.250
I'm an idiot!

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:46.950
I was so happy that I got a girlfriend,
I almost lost my one and only friend!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.290
Get it together!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:49.790
Huh?

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.250
S E R I O U S

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.700
I'm going home with Ito today. Sorry.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.830
I see... Okay.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.870
Somehow, she seems kind of sad.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:06.160
I'm glad I came here with you after all. Thanks.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:09.200
Sorry we haven't been hanging out
as much as before lately.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.040
But, you're also very important to me!

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:14.830
Why in the world are you trying to watch out for me?

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:17.370
I'm fine as long as you're happy, Tsutsui.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:21.660
Matter of fact, you can even talk
all about your love life, as much as you want!

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:25.160
No, if I start doing something like that,
you can go ahead and punch me really hard.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.160
Why?

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:29.500
Something about changing
and getting so happy is scary.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.910
Since I am that kind of otaku,

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:36.160
and since I had a hard time with girls,
or more like since I've never been chosen as a partner,

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:38.750
could I really be this happy?

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.790
I kind of understand that.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:44.700
It's made things considerably worse.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:48.410
One, two, three, four,

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:51.000
five, six, seven, eight...

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:51.660
Huh?
five, six, seven, eight...

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.200
My heart is throbbing... Dammit!

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.950
Banana...

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:11.700
Thanks.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.250
Whoa, Tsutsui?!

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.450
Even though I'm touching her, my heart isn't throbbing.

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.540
Let me go! You're gross.

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:23.080
What's her problem? You even tried to help her up...

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:27.790
Nah, I'm used to it. When we did folk dancing
in the past, I often got that reaction.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:32.540
Now that I think about it, that time...

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:37.000
Maybe... something might have happened.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.620
Tsutsun, let's go home!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.330
Will you come with me to the electronics store today?
I want to get new headphones, but...

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:47.120
Sorry, please go on ahead.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.040
What's wrong? Do you have a fever or-

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.040
S-sorry...

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.000
Just "sorry" doesn't tell me anything.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.410
Is it something I did?

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:01.950
No.

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:03.200
Then what?

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:05.910
It's nothing.

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:08.620
Okay. I'm done.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:16.540
I can't possibly say that I was in the middle
of a day dream about you, right?

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.000
Ugh, jeez!

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.790
The heck are you doing?

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:24.450
Oh, you're the one that fell.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.330
I'm Ishino! You gonna kill yourself or something?

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.290
What the hell? I'm not.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:33.620
Well, you're here by yourself in a classroom,
holding on to your knees.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.790
Sorry. I don't care after all.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:40.450
Ishino... are you in love?

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:46.080
What? Why does someone you've never talked to
suddenly have to tell you about their love life?

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.700
And with an otaku like you?

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:53.370
I feel humiliated myself! But I can't ask this to Ito,
and I don't have friends anyhow!

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:58.080
There is someone I like, at least.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:02.580
If there's someone you like...
does it get kinda weird like this?

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:06.500
Don't move back! I'm seriously asking!

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:10.750
Everyone that's in some kind of romantic relationship
probably gets weird like that.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:11.750
Like how?!

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.120
What do you mean "like how"?

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:17.160
Like when you're in front of that person,
your demeanor changes, right?

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.080
Like how?!

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:22.290
Arisa, I don't want to go home right meow!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.410
Meow, meow, meow...

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:28.290
I see, everyone's weird... I'm relieved.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.700
Want me to do it one more time?

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:31.540
Nah, I'm good.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:34.200
I don't really get it, but you should do your best.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.790
You're a gloomy guy as it is,
so you already have that handicap.

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.160
Got it, I'll do my best. Thanks, Ishino.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:42.450
Yeah.

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.370
He's a weirdo.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.750
She's surprisingly nice.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.250
I have student council today. Go ahead and leave.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.410
She's pretty angry, huh...?

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.370
Wha-? Wait!

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:06.700
Did you understand the feelings
of a person who had their hand shaken off?

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:12.830
That was quite a shock.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:16.290
I don't want to hold hands with Tsutsui!

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:19.500
I was completely fine until now, though...

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.120
You again?

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:25.910
You gonna kill yourself or something?

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.410
I'm not.

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:33.750
You're going out with that girl in Class C, aren't you?
Is it not going well?

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.120
I might have lost her.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:40.620
Only once was there a girl
who would folk dance with me.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:41.830
What the...?

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:48.410
Hey, Tsutsui... I think it might be better
if you cut your bangs a bit.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:49.250
Huh?

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.200
Wha-?!

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.580
What?! Hey!

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:55.200
If there's a girl you like,
take better care of your appearance!

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.160
