00:08:57.160 --> 00:09:00.160
It's okay, it's okay, this is my specialty.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:02.410
Those are craft scissors, though!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.290
What are you doing?

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:08.830
G-getting a haircut...

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:11.830
This person is mine.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:12.870
Don't touch him.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.040
You know...

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:23.290
I don't know how cool you think your boyfriend is,
but nothing like this would ever happen!

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:28.910
But if you know how Tsutsun is on the inside,
you might come to like him, too.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:33.200
Tsutsun, you don't let other people touch you either.

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:38.870
Do what you want.

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:45.450
That's great. Seems like you've found another girl
that'll folk dance with you, huh?

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:49.620
Folk-

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:50.450
It's nothing.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:56.910
It's just like she says. There's no way
things will end up like this with other people.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:58.620
You are unique.

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.540
That isn't true.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.620
It isn't true, Tsutsun.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:10.500
I... I'm sorry. It upset me when I saw you with a girl.

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:15.120
I'm embarrassed. I even said "this person is mine"...

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.700
But it's because you've been
acting strange lately, Tsutsun.

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:22.580
I thought that up until now
you'd been forcing yourself to go along with me.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:29.250
I may have said a lot of selfish things...
And I may have told a lot of lies.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:33.540
Do you hate me now?

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:41.410
What is up with you? What in the world
are you even worrying about?

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:44.250
I'm the one who's insecure here.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:49.370
I get so weird when I'm with you.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.540
I'm sorry I avoided you.

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:13.330
How has it been recently?

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:14.120
What?

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:15.790
What do you mean "what"?!

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:17.700
Do I have to tell you every single detail?

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.160
But I'm curious, you know!

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:23.450
Mom is so happy that you've
finally become a normal boy!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.330
I haven't become normal.
I was so very jealous of the lively high schoolers around here!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.450
I got a girlfriend but just like always, Ito is my only friend.
I was so very jealous of the lively high schoolers around here!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.700
I got a girlfriend but just like always, Ito is my only friend.
