00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:40.120
Dammit... I'm becoming a normie quick.

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:42.870
Well, that's not what I'm aiming for, though.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:43.830
Ow!

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:45.000
Look at that!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:45.830
What the...?

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:49.870
It's "Patissier Prince!" I've liked watching it recently!
Today we'll make blancmange alla boscaiola...

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:53.660
Who cares? I hope all hot guy pâtissier explode.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:54.910
They're not gonna do that!

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:56.830
As if princes explode...

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:02.080
Morning, Tsutsu- Oh...

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.830
Morning, Tsutsui!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.700
