00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.910
There are so many different methods, Tsutsun.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.700
You must like him.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:57.330
Yeah! He's so cool!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.250
Hey, hey, Shun-kun...

00:14:59.250 --> 00:14:59.870
Yeah?

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:00.830
The ramen shop we went to the other day was really yummy!

